<title>USA: Oneida Ltd Q1 net rises, includes gain.</title>
<headline>Oneida Ltd Q1 net rises, includes gain.</headline>
<dateline>ONEIDA, N.Y. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>FOR THE THREE MONTHS ENDED</p>
<p>					     APR 26, 1997  APR 27, 1996</p>
<p>(In thousands except per share amounts)</p>
<p> Net Sales					     $96,977  $82,890</p>
<p> Income from Continuing Operations		 4,412    2,522</p>
<p>Discontinued Operations (Note A):</p>
<p>  Income from discontinued operations		 --	147</p>
<p>Gain from disposal of discontinued operations</p>
<p>							     2,566	 --</p>
<p> Net income						6,978    2,669</p>
<p>Earnings Per Share of Common Stock:</p>
<p>  Continuing Operations				  .40	.23</p>
<p>  Discontinued Operations				.23	.01</p>
<p> Net Income						  .63	.24</p>
<p>Weighted Average Number of Common Shares</p>
<p>  Outstanding					   11,056   11,157</p>
<p>Note A:  Camden Wire Co Inc has been accounted for as a discontinued operation as of October 26, 1996. The net operating results of this discontinued operation are included under the caption &quot;Discontinued Operations.&quot;  Camden Wire was sold on February 12, 1997.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
